## Category: Professions

# Load order matters: Libs first (LibStub + embedded libraries have no
# dependency on our own namespace and must exist before Core.lua uses
# them), then Core sets up the namespace and saved variables, Constants
# holds pure data. Locale.lua then Locales\*.lua populate MSC.L before
# anything reads a player-facing string from it - Options.lua in
# particular calls MSC.L.* at file load time, not just from inside a
# function, so the locale tables must be fully loaded by the time it
# runs. Profession gates every feature module behind having learned
# Skinning, the feature modules depend on all of the above, and UI
# depends on every feature module existing first. Waypoint.lua and
# LureOverlay.lua are independent of each other - neither calls into
# the other - so their relative order here doesn't matter.
Libs\Libs.xml
Core.lua
Constants.lua
Locale.lua
Locales\enUS.lua
Locales\deDE.lua
Locales\esES.lua
Locales\esMX.lua
Locales\frFR.lua
Locales\itIT.lua
Locales\ptBR.lua
Locales\ruRU.lua
Locales\koKR.lua
Locales\zhCN.lua
Locales\zhTW.lua
Names.lua
Profession.lua
Quests.lua
Crafting.lua
Waypoint.lua
LureOverlay.lua
AuctionHouse.lua
Options.lua
UI.lua
